[0.000, "o", "-- what it cost on disk: raw logical bytes vs engine block bytes, indexes counted apart\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\u001b[?2004hsqlite> "]
[2.214, "o", "SELECT timeless_demo('report');\r\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[0.275, "o", "storage (raw = logical rows as queried; stored/index = engine block bytes on disk):\r\r\n  metrics     29,700,000 samples  raw    475 MB -> stored   59.7 MB  (  8.0x, 2.0 B/sample)  index 46.4 MB\r\r\n  logs         5,000,000 entries  raw    541 MB -> stored   42.2 MB  ( 12.8x, 8.4 B/entry)  index 0.48 MB\r\r\n  traces       2,880,684 spans    raw    721 MB -> stored   80.2 MB  (  9.0x, 27.8 B/span)  index 28.2 MB\r\r\n  total    raw 1737 MB -> stored 182 MB (9.5x); indexes 75.0 MB\r\r\n  file     313 MB (data + indexes + btree overhead)\r\r\nRun Time: real 0.275356 user 0.174848 sys 0.096952\r\r\n"]
